[node name="ReadAction" type="Node" parent="Handler" unique_id=1685723666]
script = ExtResource("3_5baw8")
text = "[b][font_size=18][center]CANADIAN BUREAU OF INVESTIGATION[/center][/font_size][/b]

September 14                                                                4820 Garrison Street
[right]Vancouver, BC V6B4N2[/right]

[b]NOTICE OF REASSIGNMENT[/b]

Detective Ethan Hayes,
Following the closure of the Ripeye case and the standard post-incident review, effective immediately you are reassigned to general duties at the Pritogn detachment.

This posting is intended to allow a return to lighter duties following a difficult period. No active major files are attached.

Detective Marcus will accompany you for continuity.

Local arrangements (housing, detachment access) will be coordinated through Lieutenant Reeves upon arrival.

Report no later than the date above.
[right]Division Office[/right]
[right]Pacific Region[/right]
"

